  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e9620f8c34305754d8cc9a7e49e852d9, type: 3}
  m_Name: LoadingUI_en
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  m_LocaleId:
    m_Code: en
  m_SharedData: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e6daa5837f655424db01a3cf29a778d5, type: 2}
  m_Metadata:
    m_Items: []
  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 85698592768
    m_Localized: Fighter invaders prioritizes attacking your units instead of the
      castle.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 85711175680
    m_Localized: A large number of weak units may be more powerful than a single
      strong unit.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 85711175681
    m_Localized: Commander Skills are useful to handle emergency situations.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 85711175682
    m_Localized: You can control the invader's path by using units in Siege Mode.
      Use it to build paths across the battlefield!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 85711175683
    m_Localized: Free Mode units can chase and attack invaders.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 85711175684
    m_Localized: You can quickly recruit units by using the 1, 2, 3, 4 key.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 85711175685
    m_Localized: You can equip up to 3 Commander Skills.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 85711175686
    m_Localized: Invaders will use all their might at the final wave. Lead your battles
      to victory with efficient strategies.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 85711175687
    m_Localized: 'Invaders generally will try to attack the castle.

      Beware.
      If the path is blocked they will attack the nearest unit.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 85711175688
    m_Localized: Units will take time to switch modes or to upgrade and cannot attack
      nor be controlled.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 85711175689
    m_Localized: The higher the unit's tier, the stronger their stats and skills.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 85711175690
    m_Localized: Units wearing Padded armor will take less damage and reduce the
      chance of critical hits from Crush attacks.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 85711175691
    m_Localized: Units wearing Antipierce armor will take less damage and reduce
      the chance of critical hits from Pierce attacks.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 85711175692
    m_Localized: Units wearing Steel armor will take less damage and reduce the chance
      of critical hits from Slash attacks.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 85711175693
    m_Localized: 'Some Conditions can be stacked.

      Enhanced Condition activates
      when stacked to 4.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 85711175694
    m_Localized: 'Promotion can unlock more Commander Skills.

      Earn Merit Points,
      unlock more Skills!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 85711175695
    m_Localized: Be careful! Bomber Invaders explode when their health depletes below
      10%, dealing damage to those nearby.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 85711175696
    m_Localized: 'Clear time is recorded when you win a battle.

      Use innovative
      strategies to set new records!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 85711175697
    m_Localized: You can view information about units and invaders through the Codex.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 85711175698
    m_Localized: Clear time will not be recorded if you leave mid-battle.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds: []
